#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""pick1 (decision 0242): the capability-probe table (task B). Writes tables/capability-probes.tsv and tables/capability-probes.md.
Every row is one question the guest asked the OS (observed in runs/pk-api2 + the start-up of the same run: 10,734,879 API calls, 381 distinct APIs), what our runtime answered (the return values and out
values the recorder saw), what Microsoft Learn says, what a typical Windows 10/11 desktop (GPU, DWM composition on, UI effects on, ClearType on, 100 % scaling) answers, and what the guest does with
the answer (read from the machine code at the call site; 'read' = a static reading, not a measurement). Modules by return address: FLEngine < 0x1d00000, QFC 0x1d00000-0x2000000 (QuickFontCache), dsp 0x2000000-0x4000000,
Blend2D 0x4700000-, FreeType 0x4b00000-, ILTools 0x6000000-.
A 'typical desktop' answer is NOT a Learn quote unless the Learn column says so; such answers are the author's knowledge of a default installation (UNOFFICIAL) and are marked [typ]."""
import csv, sys
H = ['id', 'api', 'question', 'ours (before pick1)', 'ours (after pick1.diff)', 'calls', 'guest call sites', 'Learn', 'typical Win10/11 desktop', 'same?', 'what the guest does with it (read)', 'path changes with the answer?', 'S-id / note']
R = []
def row(*a):
    assert len(a) == len(H), (len(a), a[:2])
    R.append(a)
# ---- SystemParametersInfoW
